  rb dis <file.rbc>  Disassemble bytecode
  rb vm <file.rbc>  Run bytecode
  rb bootstrap [out-dir]  Build the release compiler with the self-hosted compiler
  rb bootstrap [out-dir] --compiler <file>  Build a compiler other than bootstrap/compiler.rb
  rb bootstrap [out-dir] --rollback  Cut the release from the Rust frontend instead
  rb diagnostics <file>  Report errors as JSON for editors
  rb grammar  Print the TextMate grammar for .rb files
  rb keywords  Print the keyword list
  rb help        Show this help
  rb version     Show version

Example:
  rb examples/hello.rb
  rb format examples/hello.rb
  rb lint examples/hello.rb
  rb compile examples/hello.rb -o hello.rbc
  rb dis hello.rbc
  rb vm hello.rbc
